233
00:17:55,887 --> 00:17:58,723
I don't want him to misunderstand.

234
00:17:58,807 --> 00:17:59,933
No... Wait...

235
00:18:03,061 --> 00:18:04,354
Kazehaya, wait!

236
00:18:05,647 --> 00:18:08,566
You're wrong! Pin isn't the person I like.

237
00:18:11,778 --> 00:18:14,739
The one I really like is... you, Kazehaya.

238
00:18:17,075 --> 00:18:19,911
It was always you. Only you.

239
00:18:23,665 --> 00:18:25,041
Oh Kazehaya

240
00:18:26,376 --> 00:18:32,382
Please stop thinking I like someone
else. I just can't... I can't take it!

241
00:18:40,682 --> 00:18:42,934
I'm so sorry about that, really!

242
00:18:44,769 --> 00:18:47,564
I'm an idiot... I'm sorry...

243
00:18:55,488 --> 00:18:57,907
There's already someone I like.

244
00:18:59,742 --> 00:19:03,288
It's impossible... for me to
see anyone else but her.

245
00:19:05,582 --> 00:19:07,000
So, I'm sorry.

246
00:19:08,251 --> 00:19:11,212
I know. It's so obvious.

247
00:19:14,549 --> 00:19:19,679
Kazehaya, does me telling you that I
like you make you feel happy at all?

248
00:19:23,433 --> 00:19:25,393
Yeah. Thank you.

249
00:19:35,361 --> 00:19:39,574
Just this once... Call me by
my name, okay? My first name.

250
00:19:41,201 --> 00:19:42,035
Ume.

251
00:19:48,082 --> 00:19:54,380
Well, I suppose this granny name
isn't as bad as I thought then!

252
00:19:55,548 --> 00:20:00,595
Man, saying all this stuff wasn't my
intention. I really miscalculated.

253
00:20:00,678 --> 00:20:01,554
Miscalculated?

254
00:20:02,513 --> 00:20:05,016
Kazehaya... You have no eye for girls!

255
00:20:07,018 --> 00:20:07,894
See ya!

256
00:20:12,440 --> 00:20:13,691
I said it.

257
00:20:22,575 --> 00:20:26,162
It was so unlike me to
do something like that.

258
00:20:28,539 --> 00:20:31,834
But ever since then, I haven't used my
"People who called me 'Ume'" notebook a

259
00:20:31,918 --> 00:20:33,419
single time.

260
00:20:36,756 --> 00:20:38,675
Will he accept this?

261
00:20:41,719 --> 00:20:45,265
If I had to bet...
Sawako's will be homemade.

262
00:20:45,348 --> 00:20:48,476
TO TOMO, TO AYANE,
TO CHIZU, SANADA, EKKO

263
00:20:51,646 --> 00:20:57,026
Neither Ayane nor Chizu... come off
as the types to make any themselves.

264
00:21:02,740 --> 00:21:06,995
This'll be my first and last
time giving him chocolates.

265
00:21:11,958 --> 00:21:16,004
All right! I'll use my most
expensive face mask tonight!

266
00:22:27,325 --> 00:22:30,078
Even though I want to give them...

267
00:22:30,870 --> 00:22:32,789
My heart hesitates.

268
00:22:32,872 --> 00:22:34,874
Next time: "Valentine"
